<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="pb-header">
        <div class="pb-header-brand">
            <div class="pb-logo-mark">PB</div>
            <div>
                <div class="pb-logo-text">PORTAL ASISTENTE</div>
                <div class="pb-logo-name">Mis eventos</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-user">
            <div class="pb-avatar"><%= (session.userName || 'A').charAt(0).toUpperCase() %></div>
            <div class="pb-user-info">
                <span class="pb-user-name"><%= session.userName || 'Asistente' %></span>
                <a href="/asistente/logout" class="pb-user-link">Cerrar sesión</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pb-strip"></div>

    <main class="pb-main">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 28px;">
            <h1 style="margin: 0;">Hola, <%= session.userName || 'Asistente' %></h1>
            <p style="color: var(--neutral-500); margin: 6px 0 0;">Bienvenido al portal del asistente del sistema Events.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pb-card pb-card-padded" style="text-align: center; padding: 56px 32px;">
            <div style="width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--brand-secondary-soft); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1E88E5" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                    <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/>
                    <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/>
                    <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px;">Bienvenido al portal del asistente</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--neutral-500); max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 6px;">
                Aquí podrás consultar los eventos disponibles, inscribirte a ellos y llevar control de tus participaciones.
            </p>
            <p style="color: var(--neutral-500); margin: 0; font-size: 13px;">
                Las funcionalidades del módulo están en desarrollo.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Placeholder de secciones pendientes -->
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px;">

            <div class="pb-card pb-card-padded" style="opacity: 0.7;">
                <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--state-success-soft); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1B5E20" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px;">Eventos disponibles</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--neutral-500); margin: 0 0 8px;">Consulta y inscríbete a eventos académicos próximos.</p>
                <span class="pb-pill pb-pill-pending">Próximamente</span>
            </div>

            <div class="pb-card pb-card-padded" style="opacity: 0.7;">
                <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--brand-accent-soft); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8A4500" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px;">Mis inscripciones</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--neutral-500); margin: 0 0 8px;">Lleva control de los eventos a los que te inscribiste.</p>
                <span class="pb-pill pb-pill-pending">Próximamente</span>
            </div>

            <div class="pb-card pb-card-padded" style="opacity: 0.7;">
                <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--brand-secondary-soft); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1E88E5" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px;">Calendario</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--neutral-500); margin: 0 0 8px;">Visualiza por mes los eventos a los que asistirás.</p>
                <span class="pb-pill pb-pill-pending">Próximamente</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
